115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 83 0 R
/T (Organizations need to know what personal data they hold, where it is stored, why it is collected, and how long it is retained. Spreadsheets and database schemas can change over time, making manually maintained inventories unreliable. DataPulse combines configurable data detection with purpose and retention metadata, scan history, and human review. It is designed as a focused prototype using synthetic data and a structured SQL source, with privacy documentation principles informing the inventory design [1])
/E (Organizations need to know what personal data they hold, where it is stored, why it is collected, and how long it is retained. Spreadsheets and database schemas can change over time, making manually maintained inventories unreliable. DataPulse combines configurable data detection with purpose and retention metadata, scan history, and human review. It is designed as a focused prototype using synthetic data and a structured SQL source, with privacy documentation principles informing the inventory design [1])
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
