130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 85 0 R
/T (DataPluse scans synthetic CSV files and one SQL database using configurable column-name patterns, regular expressions, and value validation. It classifies candidate fields into five predefined data classes and stores their source locations, technical evidence, declared purposes, and retention metadata. Missing documentation is flagged for human review. Scan snapshots are compared to identify changes, while manually labelled synthetic test data is used to calculate per-class precision and recall. The prototype uses Python, SQLite, SQLAlchemy, and Streamlit.)
/E (DataPluse scans synthetic CSV files and one SQL database using configurable column-name patterns, regular expressions, and value validation. It classifies candidate fields into five predefined data classes and stores their source locations, technical evidence, declared purposes, and retention metadata. Missing documentation is flagged for human review. Scan snapshots are compared to identify changes, while manually labelled synthetic test data is used to calculate per-class precision and recall. The prototype uses Python, SQLite, SQLAlchemy, and Streamlit.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
