461 0 obj
<<
/Title (Traditionally, personal-data discovery relies on separate source files and manual field identification, making it difficult to maintain an accurate inventory. DataPulse improves this process by creating a centralized inventory and applying configurable detection rules to identify candidate personal-data fields. Instead of leaving purpose and retention details undocumented, the system generates metadata-gap alerts for review. It also compares scan snapshots to identify changes and maintains review records, providing better evidence than one-time scans. Detection quality is evaluated using precision and recall on manually labelled test data. Human review and minimized exposure of raw data further improve the reliability and privacy of the proposed solution.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 429 0 R
/Next 462 0 R
>>
endobj
